Package: DistLagHet
Type: Package
Title: Treatment Effect Estimation in Complex Designs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Clement", "de Chaisemartin", role = c("aut"),
           email = "chaisemartin.packages@gmail.com"),
    person("Xavier", "D'Haultfoeuille", role = c("aut"),
           email = "xavier.dhaultfoeuille@ensae.fr"),
    person("Henri", "Fabre", role = c("cre", "ctb"),
           email = "henri.fabre@ensae.fr"))
Description: Implements estimation methods for treatment effects in complex
    designs under parallel-trends assumptions. Based on the methodology of
    de Chaisemartin and D'Haultfoeuille (2025)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2508.07808>.
    Provides three model specifications: base model with K lags, full dynamics
    model using all available periods, and interactions model with lag interaction
    terms. Includes C++ optimizations for faster bootstrap estimation.
